<style>
  .help-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding-top: 3;
    padding-bottom: 3;
    padding-left: 4;
    padding-right: 4;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
    border-color: #ff6600;
    border-width: 0.12;
    border-radius: 1.5;
  }
  .help-title {
    font-size: 3;
    color: #ff6600;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 2;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .help-section {
    font-size: 1.6;
    color: #ffaa44;
    margin-top: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5;
  }
  .help-text {
    font-size: 1.2;
    color: #cccccc;
    margin-bottom: 0.3;
  }
  .help-back {
    font-size: 1.6;
    color: #aaaaaa;
    background-color: rgba(100, 100, 100, 0.2);
    border-color: #666666;
    border-width: 0.06;
    border-radius: 0.6;
    padding-top: 0.6;
    padding-bottom: 0.6;
    padding-left: 2;
    padding-right: 2;
    margin-top: 1.5;
    cursor: pointer;
    align-items: center;
  }
</style>
<div class="help-panel">
  <span class="help-title">HOW TO PLAY</span>
  <span class="help-section">VR Controls</span>
  <span class="help-text">Grip: Pick up basketball</span>
  <span class="help-text">Swing + Release Trigger: Throw ball</span>
  <span class="help-text">A Button: Confirm / Skip</span>
  <span class="help-text">B Button: Pause</span>
  <span class="help-text">Thumbstick: Navigate menus</span>
  <span class="help-section">Browser Controls</span>
  <span class="help-text">Click + Drag Up: Aim and set power</span>
  <span class="help-text">Release: Shoot</span>
  <span class="help-text">ESC: Pause</span>
  <span class="help-section">Game Modes</span>
  <span class="help-text">Free Throw: 10 shots from the line</span>
  <span class="help-text">Three-Point Contest: 5 racks of 5 balls, timed</span>
  <span class="help-text">Arcade: Progressive difficulty, score attack</span>
  <span class="help-text">H.O.R.S.E.: Match shots vs AI</span>
  <span class="help-text">Trick Shots: Bank shots and special challenges</span>
  <span class="help-text">Practice: Unlimited shooting</span>
  <span class="help-section">Scoring</span>
  <span class="help-text">Swish (no rim): 3 pts + bonus</span>
  <span class="help-text">Clean make: 2 pts</span>
  <span class="help-text">Bank shot: 2 pts + bank bonus</span>
  <span class="help-text">Streak bonus at 3+ consecutive makes</span>
  <span id="btn-help-back" class="help-back" cursor="pointer">BACK</span>
</div>
